zed-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230357"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27066"],"vndbCharacterId":"c70601"},"originalCharacterName":"水島 沙耶歌","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"理沙の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目な優等生を演じているものの、その本質は、かなりしたたかで計算高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また感受性も鋭く、主人公の本性を真っ先に見抜いたのも彼女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親の理沙とは仲が悪く、家庭内では頻繁に衝突しているようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27066","sourceWorkId":"3492","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"理沙の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"表向きは真面目な優等生を演じているが、本性は結構したたかな少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親である理沙との仲はあまり良い方でなく、家庭内では頻発に言い合いを繰り返している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人を見る目もそれなりで、最初猫をかぶっている主人公の本性に真っ先に気が付く。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"149049"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4c2af741551b339960a4985e08c5f0cc1339dfd3d932fa40695b3c357f436906.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f9eb91c66def7ba7a83bca3791c865880f18b45525789d4c62b6f51ef1849230.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"坂田有希","creatorId":"vndb:s1595","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1595","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1595","name":"坂田 有希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:230357:149049:15687:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c70602","characterName":"浦澤 結衣","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"149050","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230357"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27067"],"vndbCharacterId":"c70602"},"originalCharacterName":"浦澤 結衣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","