iler":false,"text":"結婚しているらしいが、彼女の旦那を見たものはなく、謎が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また言動も妙なところがあり、会話が噛み合わないこともしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夜な夜な出歩くことが多く、悪い噂が絶えないが、本人はまったく気にしていないようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27068","sourceWorkId":"3492","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"団地に住んでいる素性のはっきりしない女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一応結婚しているらしいが、あくまで自称であり、誰も亭主の姿をを見た事が無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言動もいささか妙で、会話が噛み合わない事もしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夜な夜な出歩いている事が多く、悪い噂も少なからずあるが、本人はまったく気にしていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧姓は皇（すめらぎ）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"149051"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23d3d1e4fd9c78c0930cc10870b2bf9a8de89602c5867b69da11621e21369b41.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d07080f89e53c535a3f1e2def928f55de4de063a97161bd7a99ea48197fe1ff.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"浅井 晴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:230357:149051:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c97125","characterName":"杉元 龍巳","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c97125"},"originalCharacterName":"杉元 龍巳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A guy who struggled getting a regular job was called out by his uncle to be his temporary caretaker due to an injury caused by an accident. At first Tatsumi wasn't very enthusiastic about helping, but he became more motivated after he found out that a woman he liked lives in his uncle's housing complex.